<a href="http://www.plasmapong.com/" class="postlink">http://www.plasmapong.com/</a><br><br>PLASMA PONG is a variation of PONG that utilizes real-time fluid dynamics to drive the game environment.<br><br>Players have several new abilities that add fun twists to the classic game. In the game you can inject plasma fluid into the environment, create a vacuum from your paddle, and blast shockwaves into the playing area. All these abilities have fluid-based kinetic effects on the ball, making Plasma Pong a fast-paced and exciting game.<p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="https://pybullet.org/Bullet/phpBB3/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=145">Antonio Martini</a> — Mon Dec 04, 2006 2:11 pm</p><hr />
